    "7F cross-marked full upper field and8F side fields are represented as a connected upper-hall void, with8F central occupied span and9F cap/terrace above. The source lacks a section: this is a declared bounded interpretation, not exact certified6F hall reconstruction. Complete6F interior and other rooms are omitted, not claimed solid in reality.",
    "R H-shaped drawing describes roof/platform below; only two end stair cores and one central core rise above it. No invented complete tenth floor, through-roof skywell, antenna/equipment assembly or foreground guardhouse/monument is included.",
    "Independent raw points and rays confirm real entrance recess,2F local column bays,+Y recess,7/8connected air,8Fcentral mass,9Fdeck/open terrace/cap, exactly3Rcores and no9Fsideprojection. Opaque window colors are not substitutes for those required voids.",
    "Five same-version renders, two matching angles, plan and reopened-native front were personally viewed. Main morphology and source-relative hand now agree within disclosed proportional simplifications. Fine window/grid counts and opaque tile/window proxies are not pixel textures or exact measured reproduction."
